      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_01206",
        "explanation": "Family demonstrated receipt of the key medication and escalation plan after confirming with nurse/pharmacist.",
        "quote": "就按她写的和带药单来"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The bounded episode was safely closed around discharge preparation and home monitoring: the family had confirmed the high-risk medication interaction question with staff, had clear medication instructions, knew oxygen/SpO2 thresholds and symptom red flags, and had respiratory follow-up timing. Remaining uncertainty about exact external CT/lab details and a minor practical SpO2-timing nuance did not leave a blocking safety risk because the plan directed rest, observation, and emergency return thresholds.",
