      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered by active transfer, paperwork, and inability to fully recite data. The doctor prioritized oxygen/monitoring/records/medication questions, gave short scripts for the receiving team, and the family successfully executed them, materially improving handoff safety.",
