          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
          "explanation": "Doctor immediately assessed consciousness, respiratory effort, and cyanosis before reassurance.",
          "quote": "意识清醒吗？呼吸是不是特别费力、嘴唇有没有发紫？"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00164",
