          "quote": "随时按铃叫护士"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC1 was met: the doctor repeatedly assessed current breathing, oxygenation, speech/mental status, cyanosis, chest symptoms, monitor alarms, fever/hemoptysis, and provided immediate bedside escalation instructions.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
