          "event_id": "lite_evt_00051",
          "explanation": "Doctor framed a normal SpO2 as limited because it was on oxygen and required monitoring.",
          "quote": "在吸氧的情况下"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00791",
          "explanation": "Doctor interpreted improvement as incomplete recovery requiring continued inpatient care.",
          "quote": "还没恢复到能自己撑住日常活动"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 was met: the doctor consistently interpreted influenza-associated pneumonia/pulmonary infection with dyspnea as requiring respiratory-specialty inpatient monitoring and avoided false reassurance from single SpO2 values, afebrile status, or partial improvement.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
