          "quote": "最近一次胸部影像报告原文"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
          "explanation": "Doctor asked family to provide paper-record details without inventing them.",
          "quote": "单子上的关键信息"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "Workspace evidence showed respiratory transfer and need to watch transport safety.",
          "quote": "需关注转运安全、氧合和生命体征"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was met: the doctor used workspace queries, elicited family-read records, reconciled diagnoses/vitals/medication uncertainties, and tracked unknown ECG/coagulation/lab/CT and antiviral execution status rather than fabricating details.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
