          "explanation": "Doctor explained antibiotic/expectorant/nebulization categories and warned against self-changing them.",
          "quote": "千万不要自己停药、减量或换药"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00107",
          "explanation": "Doctor protected hypertension/coronary medications by assigning verification to the inpatient team.",
          "quote": "先别家属自己喂"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 was met: medication advice was bounded to inpatient team verification, explained major treatment categories, pursued antiviral execution, and repeatedly warned against self-stopping or self-administering antibiotics, oxygen/nebulization, antihypertensives, or cardiac medicines.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00051",
          "explanation": "Doctor treated respiratory transfer as a safety-critical transition requiring oxygen continuation.",
          "quote": "转运途中必须一直吸氧"
