          "explanation": "Family demonstrated receipt of the monitoring and escalation plan.",
          "quote": "如果血氧一直掉到93以下"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 was met: the doctor converted the evolving assessment into owned, timed actions for family, nurse, treating respiratory team, and emergency fallback, and repeatedly obtained family teach-back/checklist confirmation.",
