          "explanation": "Doctor acknowledged uncertainty about whether antiviral therapy was already used.",
          "quote": "可能已经用了只是单子上没写全"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00315",
          "explanation": "Doctor avoided overinterpreting missing lab values and deferred decisions to the treating team.",
          "quote": "等呼吸科医生查房时统一核对安排"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC7 was met: the doctor stayed in a patient-facing support role, did not invent CT/lab results or final prognosis, framed medication issues as verification questions for clinicians, and did not recommend independent prescription changes.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "met"
